1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,980
Hi, I'm Rahul Varma and this is my story. Three decades ago, I fell in love with human resources

2
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:20,660
because I felt that this was the one function within organizations that could help people

3
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:27,660
thrive. I had an amazing career, getting responsibilities very early on. In fact,

4
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:34,540
years ago as I was leading HR for Accenture in India, my health started to decline because I was

5
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:40,560
working every single hour of the day, finally to a point where I had a near-death experience,

6
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:47,240
going into a cardiac arrest following an asthma attack because I had worked myself to the bone.

7
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:53,020
As I came out of that, I again asked this question, why am I here? And the only answer was,

8
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:59,780
I'm here to help people thrive. And I couldn't help people thrive if I didn't thrive myself.

9
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:08,260
And so I started to pay attention on my own wellness. That led to an amazing career as I lived and worked

10
00:01:08,260 --> 00:01:14,880
in different countries and had big responsibilities. And finally, over the last couple years, leading HR

11
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:23,420
for a very large part of our business that employed more than 350,000 people. But when I again started

12
00:01:23,420 --> 00:01:32,080
to ask that question, why am I here? I'm here to help people thrive. I felt like I was not being resonant

13
00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:39,480
with my purpose anymore. And so a few months ago, I decided to walk away from it all. I left a great paying

14
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:49,540
job with a huge responsibility. And I decided to dedicate myself for what I was here to help people thrive

15
00:01:49,540 --> 00:02:00,520
and to propagate meaningful ways for well-being. I'm bringing to you a video series with the intention

16
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:07,660
of raising awareness with research and facts and generating a dialogue on meaningful solutions

17
00:02:07,660 --> 00:02:16,680
that actually move the needle. And I hope we can join forces to be able to create a better future,

18
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:23,680
a better planet, a better society for all that will reside in it now and for those who are to follow.

19
00:02:24,220 --> 00:02:29,120
Thank you so much for tuning in. And I so look forward to being with you again.

20
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,520
Thank you.

